00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:24.960
as ASP, which stands for active Server Pages, or&nbsp;
classic ASP. With classic ASP Microsoft made it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:32.820
possible to have server side scripting to dynamic&nbsp;
web pages. The biggest revolution came when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:42.600
